Package: hyggshicut
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Modern, lightweight professional video editor
 A professional, modern, lightweight video editor written in C++20
 with Qt6, FFmpeg (libav*) and OpenGL 3.3 Core.
 .
 Features a multi-track timeline, GPU realtime compositing and effects
 (shaders), GPU preview, audio meters, a headless CLI render engine and
 ffmpeg-based export to MP4/MOV/MKV/WebM/MP3/WAV.
